{"obsah":"<p>The beautiful chateau gardens in Pacov provided an unusual backdrop for a meet of American cars and motorbikes of all kinds. By the main stage there was an exhibition by kids from the club, Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Lukáš Valný and, on a motorbike, Dalibor Šulc. The scorching heat didn't stop us, and after the Pin-up girls were announced there was time to walk around the whole grounds. Thanks for the invitation.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5962.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5962.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248432\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2F454350080_10228371110355146_2582058233150893339_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2F454350080_10228371110355146_2582058233150893339_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248429\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2F454052858_10228371119315370_4504219326637094594_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2F454052858_10228371119315370_4504219326637094594_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248433\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.f